msgid "No program is using it, but the system still is (see below)."
msgstr "Aucun programme ne l’utilise, mais le système l’utilise encore (voir ci-dessous)."

#: big-storage-rescue/usr/lib/big-storage-rescue/cli.sh:605
msgid "Resolve the item listed below, then try again."
msgstr "Réglez le point indiqué ci-dessous, puis réessayez."

#: big-storage-rescue/usr/lib/big-storage-rescue/cli.sh:607
msgid "None of your programs is using it. A system service or a program of another user may be holding it, or it was released a moment ago."
msgstr "Aucun de vos programmes ne l’utilise. Un service système ou un programme d’un autre utilisateur le retient peut-être, ou il vient d’être libéré."

#: big-storage-rescue/usr/lib/big-storage-rescue/cli.sh:608
msgid "Try again. If it is still busy, show the programs of all users."
msgstr "Réessayez. S’il est toujours occupé, affichez les programmes de tous les utilisateurs."

